# STAFF.DBF -- the Initech staff roster, the running example of Learning
# InitechBase and Using InitechBase.  Dates are YYYYMMDD as stored.
TABLE STAFF.DBF
FIELD EMPNO C 4 0
FIELD LASTNAME C 14 0
FIELD FIRSTNAME C 10 0
FIELD DEPT C 4 0
FIELD EXT C 4 0
FIELD HIRED D 8 0
FIELD SALARY N 9 2
FIELD EXEMPT L 1 0
FIELD NOTES M 10 0
